	)
	(text "UFP (5.1k Rd on CC1/CC2).  ESD5Z5.0 on D+, D-, VBUS at the connector.  CP2102N is self-powered from +3V3\n(VDD = VREGIN, regulator bypassed); its VBUS pin only senses the cable through 22k/47k (3.4 V at 5 V).\nUMH3N = the ESP32-S3-DevKitC-1 auto-program pair: esptool drives DTR/RTS to pulse EN and hold IO0."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 33.02 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.524 1.524)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "b355085d-6709-5f14-927f-595414637447")
	)
